    "project_team": null,
    "project_collaboration": null,
    "project_summary_1": "This bamboo piece with seven holes is given life through Lord Shri Krishna’s breath while he holds it in his hands. What I learnt during this journey of painting is that these seven holes are in tune with the seven chakras of the human body. So, the feelings of the flute player are passed onto the flute through his seven chakras and breath. That is why no two people can bring out the same melody through a given flute. The music emerges in accordance with the flute player’s mind. Mind is ever changing, and two minds can never match. Similarly, two tunes can never be the same, though they can be similar.Having come into the hands of Lord Shri Krishna, flute has transformed into a divine piece of ecstasy. Every life in this Universe is like a flute in the hands of the Creator. However, we do not understand his concept, on account of our ego and desires.",
    "project_summary_2": null,
    "project_summary_3": null,
    "project_featured_image": "https://inidesignstudio.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/Lord-Krishna-and-Flute-Ecstasy-Oil-on-Canvas-Featured-Image.jpeg",
