    "project_services": "Interior Design, PMC, Lightning Design, Sustainability,  Engineering, Turnkey Design Build, Environmental Graphic & Signage",
    "project_quote": "Design drives collaboration and provides for an adaptable and Playful work environment",
    "project_team": "<strong>Project Director/Mentor</strong><br>Jayesh Hariyani<br>Adi Mistri<br><strong>Project Associate Director</strong><br>Nikul Shah<br><strong>Design Lead - Interior</strong><br>Nikul Shah<br><strong>MEPF Director</strong><br>Amit Mehta<br><strong>Operations Director</strong><br>Bindu Hariyani<br><strong>Operations Manager</strong><br>Chintan Thanki<br><strong>Project Team </strong><br>Bhaumik Patel<br>Bhargav Bhavsar <br>Mehernosh Fanibanda <br>Aanoshka Choksi <br>Shailesh Jadhav <br>Kush Mewada <br>Vimal Ranpariya<br>Raj Dilip",
    "project_collaboration": null,
    "project_summary_1": "The office of the IL&amp;FS Dubai Office was envisioned in the contemporary paradigm, in consonance with its modern location in Dubai, UAE. The vision was to create a modern workspace where a youthful team could be productive at peak functional capacity enabled by efficacious systems set in an energetic and humane environment. This required the workspace to be infused with vibrant elements capable of proliferating it with their high-octane vibes, unhindered throughout.",
    "project_summary_2": "<strong>Dynamic workspaces for a new age community:</strong><br>The idea was to have a fluid and dynamic workspace that accommodates and encourages collaboration and innovation. Blurring the lines between work and private life building a new age community. All the spaces follow a distinct color palette held together by the white fluid surfaces. Collaborative spaces are employed and are designed to be warm, cozy, and ergonomically designed where interaction and collaboration are maximized.",
    "project_summary_3": "<strong>Blurring the boundaries between work and play:</strong><br>The design challenges the stereotypical workstation organization and re-infuses the idea of collaborative workspaces with playful curvilinear interaction - pods and a variety of clusters formed by plug-n-play of the modulated work- pods.",
    "project_featured_image": "https://inidesignstudio.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/ILFS-Transportation-Office-dubai-Featured-Image.jpg",
    "project_image_1": "https://inidesignstudio.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/ILFS-Transportation-Office-dubai-Cover-Images-1.jpg",
