    "id": 135,
    "project_title": "Shivalik Edge",
    "project_tags": "Architecture - Building Design; Interior Design; Landscape Design; Sustainability",
    "project_location": "Ahmedabad, Gujarat India",
    "project_site_area": "2,792 SM",
    "project_builtup_area": "1,19,953 SF",
    "project_services": "Architecture, Interior Design, Sustainability & Green Certification, Landscape Design",
    "project_quote": "Redefining spacious living with 4+BHK + WFH homes, with luscious greens and lavish spaces for health and well-being",
    "project_team": "<strong>Project Director/Mentor</strong><br>Jayesh Hariyani<br><strong>Design Lead - Architecture</strong><br>Bhrugu Gangadia<br><strong>Design Lead - Landscape</strong><br>Bhrugu Gangadia<br><strong>Operations Director</strong><br>Bindu Hariyani<br><strong>Operations Manager</strong><br>Chintan Thanki<br><strong>Project Team </strong><br>Shambhu Jadav <br>Bhargav Dave <br>Mayuri Kapadia <br>Vivek Joshi <br>Ragini Dutta <br>Dharmesh Panchal <br> Dsouza Lawrence<br>Dhruv Prajapati <br>Rahul Panchal <br>Harshal Kandoi <br>Hardik Patel <br>Gunjan Barot <br>Rahul Vyas",
    "project_collaboration": null,
    "project_summary_1": "Responding to the growing need of housing in the city of Ahmedabad, the INI Team develops a design solution in an elegant form and prime location curating a Sustainable Luxury Living experience for the residents of this 13-floor building.",
    "project_summary_2": "<strong>Living in the lap of luxury:</strong><br>In the chaos of the city, the Shivalik Edge residential community is designed to evoke peace and tranquillity in busy urban life for residents. The community plan integrates and provide for multiple amenities including but not limited to uniquely designed-landscaped gardens, Clubhouse with indoor sport activities, Informal seating dispersed along the community, a children's play area, a gymnasium, community theatre while providing green living environment.",
    "project_summary_3": "<strong>Healthier Design meets Modern Wellness:</strong><br>Conceived as a vertical neighbourhood Shivalik Edge spaciously overlooks breath-taking views of the city and city ring road. Understanding the needs of today's families, the 50 family apartment units include an expansive living and dining room, a kitchen, 4+ bedrooms, a work from home office space, a vestibule and a personal foyer area along with other utility and parking facilities for residents and guests. With a unique design features, luscious green areas and amenities on a prime location, Shivalik Edge becomes the modern home to aspire to live in.",
    "project_featured_image": "https://inidesignstudio.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Shivalik-Edge-Featured-Image.jpg",
    "project_image_1": "https://inidesignstudio.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Shivalik-Edge-Cover-Images.jpg",
    "project_image_2": "https://inidesignstudio.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/cam-01-scaled.jpg",
